"Ka ārai te whakaara haumaru i ngā pūmanawa kino kei utaina ina tīmata te "
"pūrere. E kā ana i tēnei wā, engari kāore e mahi nā te mea kāore tōna kī e "
"whai mana."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the second section of description.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-boot-dialog.c:89
msgid ""
"Secure boot problems can often be resolved from your device's UEFI firmware "
"settings (BIOS) and your hardware manufacturer may provide information on "
"how to do this."
msgstr ""
"I te nuinga o te wā ka taea te whakatika i ngā raruraru whakaara haumaru mā "
"ngā tautuhinga pūmanawa mārō UEFI (BIOS) o tō pūrere, ā, tērā pea ka "
"whakarato te kaiwhakanao o tō pūmārō i ngā mōhiohio mō te mahi i tēnei."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the third section of description.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-boot-dialog.c:92
msgid "For help, contact your hardware manufacturer or IT support provider."
msgstr ""
"Mō te āwhina, whakapā atu ki te kaiwhakanao o tō pūmārō, ki tō kaiwhakarato "
"tautoko IT rānei."

#. TRANSLATORS: secure boot refers to the system firmware security mode
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-boot-dialog.c:98
msgid "Secure Boot is Turned Off"
msgstr "Kua Weto te Whakaara Haumaru"

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the first section of the description.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-boot-dialog.c:103
msgid ""
"Secure boot prevents malicious software from being loaded when the device "
"starts. It is currently turned off."
msgstr ""
"Ka ārai te whakaara haumaru i ngā pūmanawa kino kei utaina ina tīmata te "
"pūrere. Kua weto i tēnei wā."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is the second section of the description.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-boot-dialog.c:106
msgid ""
"Secure boot can often be turned on from your device's UEFI firmware settings "
"(BIOS). For help, contact your hardware manufacturer or IT support provider."
msgstr ""
"I te nuinga o te wā ka taea te whakakā i te whakaara haumaru mā ngā "
"tautuhinga pūmanawa mārō UEFI (BIOS) o tō pūrere. Mō te āwhina, whakapā atu "
"ki te kaiwhakanao o tō pūmārō, ki tō kaiwhakarato tautoko IT rānei."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.blp:54
msgid "_Copy Technical Report"
msgstr "_Tārua Pūrongo Hangarau"

#. TRANSLATORS: in reference to firmware protection: 0/4 stars
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:99
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:453
msgid "Security Checks Failed"
msgstr "I Rahua ngā Arowhai Haumarutanga"

#. TRANSLATORS: This is the description to describe the failure on
#. checking the security items.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:102
msgid ""
"Hardware does not pass checks. This means that you are not protected against "
"common hardware security issues.\n"
"\n"
"It may be possible to resolve hardware security issues by updating your "
"firmware or changing device configuration options. However, failures can "
"stem from the physical hardware itself and may not be fixable."
msgstr ""
"Kāore te pūmārō e tutuki i ngā arowhai. Ko te tikanga o tēnei, kāore koe i "
"te parea mai i ngā raruraru haumarutanga pūmārō e kitea whānuitia ana.\n"
"\n"
"Tērā pea ka taea te whakatika i ngā raruraru haumarutanga pūmārō mā te "
"whakahou i tō pūmanawa mārō, mā te huri rānei i ngā kōwhiringa whirihoranga "
"pūrere. Heoi, ka ahu mai pea ngā rahunga i te pūmārō ōkiko tonu, ā, kāore "
"pea e taea te whakatika."

#. TRANSLATORS: in reference to firmware protection: 1/4 stars
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:111
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:458
msgid "Basic Security Checks Passed"
msgstr "Kua Tutuki ngā Arowhai Haumarutanga Taketake"

#. TRANSLATORS: This description describes the device passing the
#. minimum requirement of security check.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:114
msgid ""
"This device meets basic security requirements and has protection against "
"some hardware security threats. However, it lacks other recommended "
"protections."
msgstr ""
"Ka tutuki i tēnei pūrere ngā whakaritenga haumarutanga taketake, ā, he "
"parenga tōna i ētahi tuma haumarutanga pūmārō. Heoi, kāore ōna ētahi atu "
"parenga e tūtohutia ana."

#. TRANSLATORS: in reference to firmware protection: 2~4 stars
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:123
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:466
msgid "Protected"
msgstr "Kua Parea"

#. TRANSLATOR: This description describes the devices passing
#. the extended security check.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:126
msgid ""
"This device passes current security tests. It is protected against the "
"majority of hardware security threats."
msgstr ""
"Ka tutuki i tēnei pūrere ngā whakamātautau haumarutanga o nāianei. Kua parea "
"i te nuinga o ngā tuma haumarutanga pūmārō."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:132
msgid "Checks Unavailable"
msgstr "Kāore e Wātea ana ngā Arowhai"

#. TRANSLATORS: When the security result is unavailable, this description is shown.
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:134
msgid ""
"Device security checks are not available for this device. It is not possible "
"to tell whether it meets hardware security requirements."
msgstr ""
"Kāore e wātea ana ngā arowhai haumarutanga pūrere mō tēnei pūrere. Kāore e "
"taea te mōhio mēnā ka tutuki i a ia ngā whakaritenga haumarutanga pūmārō."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-dialog.c:334
msgid "Report copied to clipboard"
msgstr "Kua tāruatia te pūrongo ki te papatopenga"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-help-dialog.blp:5
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:13
msgid "About Device Security"
msgstr "Mō te Haumarutanga Pūrere"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-help-dialog.blp:28
msgid ""
"Device security provides information about how protected your device is "
"against security issues which target the hardware itself.\n"
"\n"
"Aspects of hardware that affect security include:\n"
"\n"
"• security features that are built into a hardware itself;\n"
"• how the hardware is configured to protect against security issues;\n"
"• the security of the software runs directly on the hardware.\n"
"\n"
"Security threats which affect hardware include malware and viruses that "
"target the software that runs directly on the hardware. It also includes "
"physical tampering, such as physical connection to the hardware to read data "
"and implant malware.\n"
"\n"
"Device security is just one aspect of security, and does not reflect the "
"overall security status of the system and applications."
msgstr ""
"Ka whakarato te haumarutanga pūrere i ngā mōhiohio mō te nui o te parenga o "
"tō pūrere i ngā raruraru haumarutanga e aro ana ki te pūmārō tonu.\n"
"\n"
"Ko ētahi āhuatanga o te pūmārō e pā ana ki te haumarutanga:\n"
"\n"
"• ngā āhuatanga haumarutanga kua hangaia ki roto i te pūmārō tonu;\n"
"• te āhua o te whirihora i te pūmārō hei pare i ngā raruraru haumarutanga;\n"
"• te haumarutanga o te pūmanawa e whakahaeretia tōtika ana i runga i te "
"pūmārō.\n"
"\n"
"Ko ētahi tuma haumarutanga e pā ana ki te pūmārō, ko ngā pūmanawa kino me "
"ngā huaketo e aro ana ki te pūmanawa e whakahaeretia tōtika ana i runga i te "
"pūmārō. Ka uru anō ko te raweke ōkiko, pērā i te hono ōkiko ki te pūmārō hei "
"pānui raraunga, hei kōkuhu pūmanawa kino.\n"
"\n"
"He wāhanga noa iho te haumarutanga pūrere o te haumarutanga, ā, kāore e "
"whakaata ana i te tūnga haumarutanga whānui o te pūnaha me ngā taupānga."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:5
msgid "Device Security"
msgstr "Haumarutanga Pūrere"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:36
msgid "Device Security Unavailable"
msgstr "Kāore e Wātea ana te Haumarutanga Pūrere"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:38
msgid ""
"Device Security is only available on physical hardware. No physical hardware "
"has been detected."
msgstr ""
"Ka wātea te Haumarutanga Pūrere i runga i te pūmārō ōkiko anake. Kāore he "
"pūmārō ōkiko i kitea."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:162
msgid "Security Events"
msgstr "Ngā Takunetanga Haumarutanga"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.blp:169
msgid "No Events"
msgstr "Kāore he takunetanga"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:115
msgid "Protected against malicious software when the device starts."
msgstr "Kua parea mai i ngā pūmanawa kino ina tīmata te pūrere."

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:119
msgid "Secure Boot has Problems"
msgstr "Kei te Raruraru te Whakaara Haumaru"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:121
