msgstr "Kua Weto te Whakaara Haumaru"

#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:125
msgid "No protection when the device is started."
msgstr "Kāore he parenga ina tīmata te pūrere."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is to explain an event that has already happened
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:143
msgid ""
"This issue could have been caused by a change in UEFI firmware settings, an "
