"mārō UEFI, i tētahi huringa whirihoranga pūnaha whakahaere, i ngā pūmanawa "
"kino rānei i tēnei pūnaha."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is to explain an event that has already happened
#: panels/privacy/firmware-security/cc-firmware-security-page.c:149
msgid ""
"This issue could have been caused by a change in the UEFI firmware settings, "
