msgstr ""
"Tērā pea i ahu mai tēnei raruraru i tētahi huringa i ngā tautuhinga pūmanawa "
"mārō UEFI, i ngā pūmanawa kino rānei i tēnei pūnaha."

#. TRANSLATORS: this is to explain an event that has already happened
